        "description": "<p>Imports products to your group in vk.com from your online store on Woocommerce.</p>\n<p>Detailed instructions with screenshots <a href=\"https://icopydoc.ru/nastrojka-plagina-import-products-to-vk/?utm_source=wp-repository&amp;utm_medium=content&amp;utm_campaign=import-products-to-vk&amp;utm_content=readme&amp;utm_term=documentation\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">here</a></p>\n<p>PRO version: <a href=\"https://icopydoc.ru/product/import-products-to-vk-pro/?utm_source=wp-repository&amp;utm_medium=content&amp;utm_campaign=import-products-to-vk&amp;utm_content=readme&amp;utm_term=pro-version\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">https://icopydoc.ru/product/import-products-to-vk-pro/</a></p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='what%20plugin%20online%20store%20supported%20by%20your%20plugin%3F'>\nWhat plugin online store supported by your plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Only Woocommerce.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.8.3</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 23-11-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.8.2</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 28-09-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bug with update the token mechanism.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.8.1</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 04-06-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bug with update the token mechanism.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.8.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 23-05-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The photo upload mechanism has been changed.</li>\n<li>The token update mechanism has been changed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.8</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 28-04-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The photo upload mechanism has been changed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.7</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date 09-04-2025</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs with getting a token.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n<li>The interface has been updated</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The interface has been updated</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n<li>The interface has been updated</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n<li>The interface has been updated</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.7.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The image import mechanism has been redesigned</li>\n<li>The interface has been updated</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.10</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The interface has been updated</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>The plugin now works with API version 5.199</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Now you can add general text to the description of all products</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.6.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added the ability not to import the quantity of the product</li>\n<li>Slightly improved interface</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.5.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated instructions</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Now you can add a button to go to the product card on your website</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support for stock amount </li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added information about compatibility with HPOS</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.4.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n<li>Added extensions PRO. See extensions page!</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Now you can add a link to the product in the description</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Minor updates</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.3.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added support for External products</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.2.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs with description</li>\n<li>Added support for &#8216;sku, &#8216;dimensions&#8217;, &#8216;weight&#8217;</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs with uploading images</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs with saving categories</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed bugs</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>0.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First relise</li>\n</ul>\n"
